1. Added `__shared__ float s_inv_freq[64]` for precomputed inv_freq
2. Cooperative computation of inv_freq before the main loop
3. `__syncthreads()` to ensure inv_freq is ready
4. Moved the bounds check after the shared memory computation
5. Changed `pow()` to `s_inv_freq[pair_idx]` lookup
6. Changed `sincos(double)` to `__sincosf(float)`

